  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The variation of the rate of an enzyme catalyzed reaction with substrate concentration is correctly represented by graph</p><p>(a)<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b6e53a6f-e4e8-4c67-ad6c-759878032075-9894256_A.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 235px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p>(b)<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7ebbfb48-46df-41eb-8271-a7b0d24190fb-9894256_B.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 235px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p>(c)<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/a8e425bb-4880-42cb-aac5-350134d6d764-9894256_C.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 233px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p>(d)<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d333bce6-4c93-49c5-8410-f543f9072a1d-9894256_D.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 233px;\" />&nbsp;</p>",
